{
    "id":  1673,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "RGB PAR56 45W LED Lamp Pool Light - G53",
    "reference":  "8210",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePAR56 45W RGB LED lamp\u003c/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003eswimming pools\u003c/strong\u003e is designed to replace halogen spotlights in swimming pools. It includes internal RGB controller and remote control for its control.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe spotlight has a degree of protection against access by particles, dust or liquids of \u003cstrong\u003eIP68\u003c/strong\u003e, in which case it can be operated during complete and continuous immersion. \u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eRGB PAR56 45W LED Lamp Pool Light - G53\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubmersible \u003cstrong\u003eRGB LED PAR56 spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003eswimming pools\u003c/strong\u003e. With body made of high resistance glass, hardened and sealed \u003cstrong\u003eIP68\u003c/strong\u003e, CE and ROHS certified. It incorporates 460pcs of SMD2835 LED chip. The luminaire has an aluminium reflector that amplifies the luminosity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRequires \u003cstrong\u003eAC12V\u003c/strong\u003e power supply not included.  Its high LED technology offers excellent lighting and a saving of up to 90% in electricity consumption. It is made of high resistance glass.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLED PAR pool bulbs are ideal for accent lighting. They do not generate UV radiation. LED PAR bulbs are ideal for replacing halogen pool bulbs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003ePAR lamp\u003c/strong\u003e offers an extraordinary lighting atmosphere and can create the desired ambience, being the perfect choice to replace traditional incandescent bulbs recessed in a pool niche.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes RF remote control to switch on/off, select colour (white, red, orange, yellow, green, blue, purple...), effects (transitions, colour jumps...).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnergy efficiency superior to any traditional incandescent halogen.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLuminous beam free of UV or IR rays.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow operating temperature.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications of the RGB PAR56 45W LED Lamp Pool Light - G53\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSwimming pools\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJacuzzi\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePonds\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFountains\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAquariums\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/focos-led-pisicna-ip68.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
